ction et_pb_section_1 et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_blog_0 et_blog_grid_equal_height et_animated et_pb_blog_grid_wrapper et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blog_grid clearfix \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_salvattore_content\" data-columns=\"\">\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23948894\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_0 post-23948894 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-translation\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/expressions-from-the-it-crowd/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/the-it-crowd-400x250.webp\" alt=\"10 Expressions from The IT Crowd Challenging for Non-Native Speakers\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/the-it-crowd.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/the-it-crowd-400x250.webp 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \" width=\"400\" height=\"250\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/expressions-from-the-it-crowd/\">10 Expressions from The IT Crowd Challenging for Non-Native Speakers</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Apr 20, 2026</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/translation/\" rel=\"tag\">Translation</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Ten lines from The IT Crowd, from “have you tried turning it off and on again?” to “them glasses is shit, innit?”, that reveal why British humour is so tricky to translate. Dry delivery, class references, absurd premises: exactly the stuff machines quietly miss.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23950836\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_1 post-23950836 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-good-to-know category-culture\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-footballers/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/The-Footballers-who-shaped-a-Nation-400x250.avif\" alt=\"From Beckham to Bellingham: Footballers Who Shaped a Nation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/The-Footballers-who-shaped-a-Nation.avif 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/The-Footballers-who-shaped-a-Nation-400x250.avif 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \" width=\"400\" height=\"250\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-footballers/\">From Beckham to Bellingham: Footballers Who Shaped a Nation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Jan 5, 2026</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/good-to-know/\" rel=\"tag\">Good to Know</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/culture/\" rel=\"tag\">Culture</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>British footballers playing abroad face more than tactical challenges. Language, culture, and communication shape their integration, performance, and public image.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23950184\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_2 post-23950184 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-culture tag-british-culture\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/8-british-habits-that-stand-out-abroad/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Unconcious-British-Habits.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Unconcious-British-Habits-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Unconcious-British-Habits-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"7 Unconscious British Habits That Especially Stand Out Abroad\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Unconcious-British-Habits.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Unconcious-British-Habits-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/8-british-habits-that-stand-out-abroad/\">7 Unconscious British Habits That Especially Stand Out Abroad</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Oct 17, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/culture/\" rel=\"tag\">Culture</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>British quirks stand out abroad, from endless apologies to obsessive queuing. This playful look explores what makes these habits charming and how cultural awareness, like BeTranslated’s, bridges global understanding.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23950400\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_3 post-23950400 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-business-tips category-ai category-machine-translation tag-ai tag-business tag-translation\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/ai-disadvantages-for-businesses/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/AI-Cant-Think-for-You.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/AI-Cant-Think-for-You-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/AI-Cant-Think-for-You-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"AI Can’t Think for You! A Wake-Up Call for Businesses Relying Too Heavily on AI\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/AI-Cant-Think-for-You.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/AI-Cant-Think-for-You-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/ai-disadvantages-for-businesses/\">AI Can’t Think for You! A Wake-Up Call for Businesses Relying Too Heavily on AI</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Oct 10, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/business-tips/\" rel=\"tag\">Business Tips</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/ai/\" rel=\"tag\">AI</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/machine-translation/\" rel=\"tag\">Machine Translation</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>AI speeds up workflows, yet trusting it too much invites errors, weakens accountability and erodes expertise. Learn how human oversight and cultural awareness protect quality, reputation and compliance.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23949695\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_4 post-23949695 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-good-to-know\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-english/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-Confused-policemen.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-Confused-policemen-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-Confused-policemen-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"Lost in translation? The Eccentric Differences within British English\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-Confused-policemen.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-Confused-policemen-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-english/\">Lost in translation? The Eccentric Differences within British English</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Sep 26, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/good-to-know/\" rel=\"tag\">Good to Know</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>British English is full of eccentricities, from bonnie Scots to Scouse banter. Explore the quirks that make our language charmingly confusing.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23949721\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_5 post-23949721 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-culture\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-characters/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Unforgettable-British-TV-Shows-2.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Unforgettable-British-TV-Shows-2-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Unforgettable-British-TV-Shows-2-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"Legends of the Small Screen: Unforgettable British Characters\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Unforgettable-British-TV-Shows-2.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Unforgettable-British-TV-Shows-2-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/british-characters/\">Legends of the Small Screen: Unforgettable British Characters</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Sep 24, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/culture/\" rel=\"tag\">Culture</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>From Del Boy to Fleabag, British TV has created icons that travel far beyond the UK. Subtitled or dubbed worldwide, these characters prove that British humour and drama connect with audiences everywhere.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23949786\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_6 post-23949786 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-education category-language-learning category-students\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/language-degrees/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Language-Degrees.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Language-Degrees-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Language-Degrees-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"Useless or Underrated? The Surprising Value of Language Degrees\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Language-Degrees.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Language-Degrees-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/language-degrees/\">Useless or Underrated? The Surprising Value of Language Degrees</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Sep 24, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/education/\" rel=\"tag\">Education</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/language-learning/\" rel=\"tag\">Language learning</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/students/\" rel=\"tag\">Students</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Language degrees aren’t useless. They’re gateways to global careers. At BeTranslated, we know how valuable linguists truly are.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23949022\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_7 post-23949022 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-language-learning category-funny category-tips-tricks\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/spanish-phrases/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/spanish-phrases.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/spanish-phrases-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/spanish-phrases-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"Speak Like a Local or Get Lost in Translation: Your Guide to Spanish Phrases\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/spanish-phrases.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/spanish-phrases-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/spanish-phrases/\">Speak Like a Local or Get Lost in Translation: Your Guide to Spanish Phrases</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Sep 1, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/language-learning/\" rel=\"tag\">Language learning</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/funny/\" rel=\"tag\">Funny</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/tips-tricks/\" rel=\"tag\">Tips and tricks</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Master the most common Spanish phrases to connect with locals and boost your confidence when travelling or doing business in Spain. Start your language journey today</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-23949567\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_8 post-23949567 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-translation-agency category-translation-services\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/translation-services-for-optical-practices/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><picture loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/optical-practices.jpg.webp 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/optical-practices-400x250.jpg.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\">\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/optical-practices-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"Translation Services for Optical Practices 👓\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/optical-practices.jpg 479w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/optical-practices-400x250.jpg 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n</picture>\n</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/translation-services-for-optical-practices/\">Translation Services for Optical Practices 👓</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"published\">Jul 29, 2025</span> | <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/translation-agency/\" rel=\"tag\">Translation agency</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/category/translation-services/\" rel=\"tag\">Translation services</a></p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Support for UK optical practices, with industry‑specific translation services and localisation that support clear multilingual patient care and compliance.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div><div class=\"pagination clearfix\">\n\t<div class=\"alignleft\"><a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/blog/page/2/?et_blog\">« Older Entries</a></div>\n\t<div class=\"alignright\"></div>\n</div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t",
  "bodyText": "BeTranslated\n\nTranslation blog\nYour Language Resource Hub\nInsights, tips, and news for language and translation enthusiasts\nGet a Quote\nWatch Our Video\n10 Expressions from The IT Crowd Challenging for Non-Native Speakers\nApr 20, 2026 | Translation\nTen lines from The IT Crowd, from “have you tried turning it off and on again?” to “them glasses is shit, innit?”, that reveal why British humour is so tricky to translate. Dry delivery, class references, absurd premises: exactly the stuff machines quietly miss.\nFrom Beckham to Bellingham: Footballers Who Shaped a Nation\nJan 5, 2026 | Good to Know, Culture\nBritish footballers playing abroad face more than tactical challenges. Language, culture, and communication shape their integration, performance, and public image.\n7 Unconscious British Habits That Especially Stand Out Abroad\nOct 17, 2025 | Culture\nBritish quirks stand out abroad, from endless apologies to obsessive queuing. This playful look explores what makes these habits charming and how cultural awareness, like BeTranslated’s, bridges global understanding.\nAI Can’t Think for You! A Wake-Up Call for Businesses Relying Too Heavily on AI\nOct 10, 2025 | Business Tips, AI, Machine Translation\nAI speeds up workflows, yet trusting it too much invites errors, weakens accountability and erodes expertise. Learn how human oversight and cultural awareness protect quality, reputation and compliance.\nLost in translation? The Eccentric Differences within British English\nSep 26, 2025 | Good to Know\nBritish English is full of eccentricities, from bonnie Scots to Scouse banter. Explore the quirks that make our language charmingly confusing.\nLegends of the Small Screen: Unforgettable British Characters\nSep 24, 2025 | Culture\nFrom Del Boy to Fleabag, British TV has created icons that travel far beyond the UK. Subtitled or dubbed worldwide, these characters prove that British humour and drama connect with audiences everywhere.\nUseless or Underrated? The Surprising Value of Language Degrees\nSep 24, 2025 | Education, Language learning, Students\nLanguage degrees aren’t useless. They’re gateways to global careers. At BeTranslated, we know how valuable linguists truly are.\nSpeak Like a Local or Get Lost in Translation: Your Guide to Spanish Phrases\nSep 1, 2025 | Language learning, Funny, Tips and tricks\nMaster the most common Spanish phrases to connect with locals and boost your confidence when travelling or doing business in Spain. Start your language journey today\nTranslation Services for Optical Practices 👓\nJul 29, 2025 | Translation agency, Translation services\nSupport for UK optical practices, with industry‑specific translation services and localisation that support clear multilingual patient care and compliance.\n« Older Entries",
